#
# Per-Dockerfile ignore file for services/bujo-pdf/Dockerfile (BuildKit
# convention: <dockerfile-name>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile FULLY
# REPLACES the root .dockerignore for this build). The build context is the
# repo root (see docker-compose.yml), so trim everything the image does not
# COPY to keep builds fast.
.git
node_modules/
analyser/
samples/
archive/
screenshots/
uploads/
shots/
scraps/
site/
docs/
tests/
tools/
deploy/
*.md
